  "title": "Orchard Core: What It Is and What You Can Build | Orchard Core",
  "description": "Orchard Core is both a content management system and an application framework for ASP.NET Core, and it is hard to choose where to start without a picture of the whole.\n\nThis video explains what Orchard Core is, shows a site and its admin, and walks through its building blocks: content, themes, widgets, features, recipes and tenants. It ends with the kinds of projects you can build and where to read more.\n\nIn this video:\n• What Orchard Core is: a framework, and a CMS built on it\n• A site and its admin\n• Content items and content types\n• Themes, widgets and layers\n• Features and recipes\n• Many sites, one application\n• What you can build\n• Where to go next",
